WEBVTT

00:17:58.829 --> 00:18:02.538
Don't overthink it and do not judge
yourself, for heaven's sake.

00:18:02.996 --> 00:18:06.538
But if you are inspired to
do so, record yourself,

00:18:06.538 --> 00:18:12.079
record your sentence and send it to
me at Zig-Zag at stable dotcom.

00:18:12.538 --> 00:18:18.288
And after that, please make sure to take
the self reflective survey. I ask you.

00:18:18.413 --> 00:18:23.454
Questions to help you consider how you are
thinking about money and vacations

00:18:23.454 --> 00:18:29.288
and creativity right now, all kinds of
things go to Zig-Zag Pod Dotcom,

00:18:29.538 --> 00:18:34.038
click on the link. Your responses and
your data will be anonymized.